<title>UK: Schleswig-Holstein adds 100 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Schleswig-Holstein adds 100 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 300 million marks from 200 million marks, lead</p>
<p>manager Commerzbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEINISCHE LANDSCHAFT HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT  **300 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.50	MATURITY    16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE REX-LINKED	ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    28.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> FEES	 UNDISCLOSED</p>
<p>NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN COUPON LINKED TO REX 10-YEAR</p>
<p>YIELD</p>
<p>		SUBINDEX TIMES 80 PCT.</p>
<p>		PFANDBRIEF SERIES 642</p>
<p>	    **ORIGINAL 100 MLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 04.JUL AT 100.0</p>
<p>		AND INCREASED TO 200 MLN MARKS ON 09.JUL.97.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
